            <ArticleTitle>Rotator cuff disease: a review of diagnosis, pathophysiology, and current trends in treatment.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>604-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article reviews the anatomy, pathophysiology, and treatment of rotator cuff disease. A plan is presented to assist the clinician in making the appropriate diagnosis and proceed with adequate workup and treatment of a patient with shoulder pain.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
